      "id": "noellesroles:awesome_binglus",
      "tab": "ROLE",
      "sourceModId": "noellesroles",
      "nameKey": "announcement.role.awesome_binglus",
      "summaryKey": "guidebook.sparkassist.content.role.overview",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "quote",
              "text": "格调制造机。"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "好人阵营的趣味身份：没有特殊能力，但开局带着一大叠【便条】，可以在车厢里尽情留言。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "初始物品",
              "tone": "item"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "开局获得 16 张【便条】。潜行时使用写字，再对着墙或地面使用贴出去。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "玩法建议",
              "tone": "good"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "用便条标记尸体位置、可疑的房间，或者把情报留给警职。"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "你没有自保能力，和平民一样要结伴、做任务。"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "超级宾格鲁斯默认不会出现在对局中。",
              "tone": "muted"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "ownerRoleIds": [],
      "requiredModIds": [
        "noellesroles"
      ],
      "color": "#9BFFA8",
